{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/extras/shotmontage.gif?t=1743775198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic RTS action meets modern production and performance in Tempest Rising. Inspired by RTS greats of the 90s and 2000s, Tempest Rising is a classic, base-building real time strategy game set in a modern day alternative history war scenario. It features 3 unique factions, each with its own approach to combat and economy and offering a variety of strategies for players of all stripes, deep and rewarding gameplay that keeps a focus on strategy while rewarding skill, and built-in customization options that allow players to approach the game their way in both single player and multiplayer game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of Commander in the highly mobile and advanced peacekeeping corps of the Global Defense Forces or the hard-hitting and desperate Tempest Dynasty in 2 11-mission campaigns that allow the player to customize their army for each mission, as both armies seek to understand and control the mysterious but beneficial Tempest vines that grow unchecked across the war-torn planet Earth. Other dangers wait in the shadows, as the origin of the Tempest is revealed...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/extras/basemontage.gif?t=1743775198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic RTS base building with fast and fluid hard-hitting\u00a0combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 asymmetrical factions, (2 playable at launch), each featuring distinct economy and play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each faction offers a unique roster of units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 epic single player campaigns with between-mission cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skirmish, custom games, and ranked multiplayer matchmaking with Glicko-2 rating.</p></li></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/extras/binocularslong.gif?t=1743775198\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1486920?t=1743775198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743775198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/d95b5528c7c6ba1a433d5b10c47fbaa222396d0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743775198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/d95b5528c7c6ba1a433d5b10c47fbaa222396d0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743775198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains soldiers getting shot, burned, blown up, or crushed under tanks."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Edition Breakdown</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/extras/preordergraphicssteamnew.png?t=1743775198\" /></p></p><br><h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/extras/beautyshotsteamnew-STEAMVERSION.png?t=1743775198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Tempest Rising Deluxe Edition Contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7-Day Early Unlock (Pre-Order Content)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be one of the first players to conquer the battleground a week early before the official launch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Commander Pack\u00a0 (Pre-Order Content)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pack of cosmetic goods designed to add a modern military flair to your visuals and enhance your experience, granting players additional options for in-game menus, selection boxes, the look of their structures, and more.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tempest Rising Digital Artbook</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Page after page of curated artwork, concepts, and stories hand-chosen by the team behind the game!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tempest Rising Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full digital game soundtrack features 41 tracks from a swath of artists. Led by the legendary Command &amp; Conquer composer <strong>Frank Klepacki </strong>plus community favorites like <strong>Michael Markie</strong>, <strong>Hexenkraft, Music Imaginary: Cielecki/Skorupa/Wierzynkiewic</strong> and <strong>Sigurd J\u00f8hnk-Jensen.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Commander Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Commander Pack </strong>is Available for players who <strong>pre-order</strong> the game and includes the following <strong>exclusive</strong> items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Chat Icon</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand out and talk back with a little extra flair! Display this premium camouflage version of the player icon featured in the chat window. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Night Vision Player Profile</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This edition of the player profile will transform your player frame and the backdrop of your gameplay statistics into striking, night vision versions that stand apart from the standard GDF/Dynasty editions. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Construction Yard Skin</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch up the appearance of your Construction Yard with this tactical edition of the standard skin. Designed to work in synergy with other Tactical cosmetics, it applies a distinct camouflage appearance that works with both Dynasty and GDF Construction Yards. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Neutral Structure Skin</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your display of battlefield dominance with this tactical-edition skin for captured neutral structures. Complimenting other \u201cTactical\u201d assets, your stranglehold of autonomy across key checkpoints will be unparalleled with the flair to match.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scanner Selection Shape</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Able to mirror the color chosen by the player when used in skirmish and multiplayer modes, this hexagonal alternative to the standard selection shape constantly rotates beneath your units giving the impression that your troops are always searching for the next engagement. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cCommander\u201d Cursor Option</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your command with a unique cursor skin! Go bold with vibrant green, stay sharp with a tactical design, or blend in with stealthy camouflage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cCommander\u201d Selection Box</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Direct your units and dominate the battlefield with style. This is a diamond-shaped texture for your selection box providing an extra option for a style-conscious Commander.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Avatar Icons</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Separate yourself from the pack and demonstrate your commitment to your favorite faction with two additional player icons for your avatar. Choose between key figures in the campaign\u2013Dr. Francis from the GDF and Aleks from the Dynasty\u2013and remind yourself of where your loyalties lie.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cCommander\u201d Main Menu Backdrop</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the command compound with this additional animated background that places you inside the control center. Applies to the main menu of the game.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/extras/shotmontage.gif?t=1743775198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic RTS action meets modern production and performance in Tempest Rising. Inspired by RTS greats of the 90s and 2000s, Tempest Rising is a classic, base-building real time strategy game set in a modern day alternative history war scenario. It features 3 unique factions, each with its own approach to combat and economy and offering a variety of strategies for players of all stripes, deep and rewarding gameplay that keeps a focus on strategy while rewarding skill, and built-in customization options that allow players to approach the game their way in both single player and multiplayer game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of Commander in the highly mobile and advanced peacekeeping corps of the Global Defense Forces or the hard-hitting and desperate Tempest Dynasty in 2 11-mission campaigns that allow the player to customize their army for each mission, as both armies seek to understand and control the mysterious but beneficial Tempest vines that grow unchecked across the war-torn planet Earth. Other dangers wait in the shadows, as the origin of the Tempest is revealed...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/extras/basemontage.gif?t=1743775198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic RTS base building with fast and fluid hard-hitting\u00a0combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 asymmetrical factions, (2 playable at launch), each featuring distinct economy and play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each faction offers a unique roster of units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 epic single player campaigns with between-mission cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skirmish, custom games, and ranked multiplayer matchmaking with Glicko-2 rating.</p></li></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/extras/binocularslong.gif?t=1743775198\" /></p>","developers":["Slipgate Ironworks\u2122"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486920/header.jpg?t=1743775198","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92023 3D Realms Entertainment, Denmark. Developed by Slipgate Ironworks ApS. Tempest Rising and 3D Realms and their respective logos are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of 3D Realms Entertainment ApS. All rights reserved. All other trademarks, logos and copyrights are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101607,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store